WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.329 --> 00:00:03.199
The question is, "Does your WHY change in
time?"

00:00:03.199 --> 00:00:05.200
The answer is, no it does not.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.390
We all only have one WHY.

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:12.230
Our WHY is fully formed, probably in our late
teens, something like that.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:17.020
And the rest of our lives offer us opportunities
to live in balance with that WHY, or not.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:21.939
Now, the language can evolve for sure, but
the basic idea, the basic sentiment of what

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:25.090
the WHY is, is permanent.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.039
It is basically an origin story.

00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:28.130
That's what a WHY is.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:33.090
A WHY is a sum total of who we are based on
how we were raised, the experiences we had

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.090
as kids.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:37.290
Just like the WHY for an organization is also
basically an origin story.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.090
It's where the organization comes from.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:43.230
It's based on the problem that the founders
were trying to solve or the opportunity they

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.330
were trying to grasp, whatever it is.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:46.700
So, your WHY is fixed.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:47.700
Your WHY is permanent.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.710
The language can evolve but you are who you
are.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.300
We are who we all are.

